What You Can Say in an Interview Now

I built a Loan Policy Assistant using FastAPI, LangChain, LangGraph, ChromaDB and Ollama. The application ingests loan policy documents into ChromaDB, generates embeddings using Ollama, uses LangGraph for routing, retrieves relevant context through RAG, and returns contextual answers via a REST API exposed through FastAPI.

